# User Stories - Smart Clinic Management System

## 👨‍⚕️ Doctor
- As a doctor, I can view my scheduled appointments.
- As a doctor, I can add prescriptions for a patient.
- As a doctor, I can view patient history.

## 🧍 Patient
- As a patient, I can register and log in securely.
- As a patient, I can book, reschedule, or cancel appointments.
- As a patient, I can view my prescriptions and visit history.

## 🧑‍💼 Admin
- As an admin, I can manage doctors, patients, and appointments.
- As an admin, I can generate reports of clinic activities.
- As an admin, I can remove inactive accounts.
